{"id":"n71538-1-8","stage":1,"title":"진짜 · 真","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71538-1-8-1","ko":"지수랑 민준이랑 사귄대.","zh":"听说智秀和敏俊在交往呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수랑","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"지수랑","audio":"/audio/3d2c488c84f071af04fd.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"민준이랑","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"사귄대.","meaning":"交往（本句指恋爱交往）","explanation":"사귀다：交往（本句指恋爱交往）；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"사귀다","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15656","senseId":"1","lemma":"사귀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cdf64a5f4a894678","term":"사귀다","zh":"交往（本句指恋爱交往）","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3","entryId":"15656","definition":"交往（本句指恋爱交往）","pronunciation":["사귀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/570ba5dddc108dbd4e88.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71538-1-8-2","ko":"진짜야? 그냥 헛소문 아닐까? 난 안 믿어져.","zh":"真的吗？不会只是谣言吧？我可不信。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"진짜야?","meaning":"真，真的","explanation":"진짜：真，真的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71538","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"只是、不过（本句用来淡化“谣言”这一说法）","explanation":"그냥：只是、不过（本句用来淡化“谣言”这一说法）","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헛소문","meaning":"谣言，谣传，风言风语","explanation":"헛소문：谣言，谣传，风言风语","readings":[{"term":"헛소문","audio":"/audio/a3bbc990613456094b57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86973","senseId":"1","lemma":"헛소문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아닐까?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"아닐까","audio":"/audio/f8f42b836fe290ea5a92.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"믿어져.","meaning":"信，相信；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"믿다：信，相信；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69478","senseId":"1","lemma":"믿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真，真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71538","definition":"不是赝品或虚构的产物。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"只是、不过（本句用来淡化“谣言”这一说法）","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"只是、不过（本句用来淡化“谣言”这一说法）","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"a3bbc99061345609","term":"헛소문","zh":"谣言，谣传，风言风语","audio":"/audio/a3bbc990613456094b57.mp3","entryId":"86973","definition":"在人群中广泛传播的没有根据的话。","pronunciation":["헏쏘문"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"03fdf42bef953df4","term":"믿다","zh":"信，相信","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3","entryId":"69478","definition":"认为正确或是事实。","pronunciation":["믿따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c17e6ecddc42a7fe7747.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.413,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71538","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6519,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的吗？不会只是谣言吧？我可不信。","我是六十号。","听说智秀和敏俊在交往呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真的吗？不会只是谣言吧？我可不信。","听说智秀和敏俊在交往呢。","我是六十号。"],"answer":0}]}
